   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_07"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "How early should I actually turn up to an interview?",
   "est_sec": 3.2,
   "gap_before": 0.35,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg12",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Aim to be in the building about ten minutes before. Earlier than that can put pressure on the interviewer.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.14,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Really? I thought earlier was always better.",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.73,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg12",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Getting to the area early is great. Just wait in a cafe nearby rather than in their reception for half an hour.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 1.68,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "What if the train's late?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.36,
   "block": "job_interview.dlg12",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Leave enough buffer for one delay, and save the recruiter's number in your phone so you can call if something goes wrong.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
   "gap_before": 0.85,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg12"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, I'll plan to be",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.11,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "job_interview.dlg12"
  },
  {
